<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.36.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.36.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.35.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.36.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 17 release story started. The latest discipline files were read again from GitHub before the step (OE_Operating_Discipline_v2_41_0, LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE_v163_0_7). Route note on the template change of 1.35.0: template 9.54.1 was made inside the page build task of the same lineage (the page test of that task failed on it), not as a separate story; this record says so openly."""@en .

ex:ST10_Release_17 backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress .
