    backlog:hasAuditNote "Started 2026-11-25. Evidence for the review record: deck 4.0.0 rendered to 59 slide images and read as three contact sheets; the logs of deck checks in 08-tooling/ch17-deck/logs_v4_0_0; the page test of 9.23.0." .
